WEBVTT

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:15.300
You can come out now, Ango.

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:17.720
Go take a shower and get some sleep.

00:00:19.390 --> 00:00:21.140
But don't be late for the morning class.

00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:23.140
Mr. Kaname...

00:00:34.490 --> 00:00:36.200
Are you all right, Ango?

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:37.450
I'm fine.

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:39.160
It was nothing, really.

00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:40.580
Ango!

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:43.370
I stayed up waiting for you to return.

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:45.580
What? You kind of stink.

00:00:46.330 --> 00:00:48.460
Go to bed!
And make sure to get up on time!

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:52.050
You have to do your best to stay on top
and be among the chosen seven, Shigeru!

00:00:53.470 --> 00:00:54.510
Ango?

00:01:01.720 --> 00:01:02.890
Sorry, Ango.

00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:06.310
I was trying to get him out
for some exercise before everyone woke up.

00:01:06.770 --> 00:01:07.650
Gengoro...

00:01:09.230 --> 00:01:15.110
<i>Fire, water, wind, earth, animals,
plants, and medicine.</i>

00:01:15.490 --> 00:01:19.200
<i>We each chose two of these
seven specializations to focus on.</i>

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:21.870
<i>Gengoro is in the animal class.</i>

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:23.540
He's gotten pretty big, right?

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:25.210
I named him Tango.

00:01:25.750 --> 00:01:27.460
He's still just a kid inside, though.

00:01:30.290 --> 00:01:31.630
You can pet him if you want.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:33.710
Petting animals calms us down.

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:44.390
<i>There was no "outside world" for us.</i>

00:01:45.640 --> 00:01:49.440
<i>Except for the chosen seven,
none of us would ever leave here alive.</i>

00:03:24.990 --> 00:03:25.910
COLD DEW

00:03:25.990 --> 00:03:28.410
<i>Think. I need to think constantly.</i>

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:31.210
<i>If I didn't have a toothbrush,
how would I make one?</i>

00:03:31.710 --> 00:03:32.960
<i>Horse hairs maybe?</i>

00:03:33.460 --> 00:03:35.170
<i>A mirror. How would I make one?</i>

00:03:35.670 --> 00:03:37.050
<i>What could be a good substitute?</i>

00:03:37.420 --> 00:03:38.920
<i>I need to make this a habit.</i>

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:41.430
<i>I have to sharpen my senses.</i>

00:03:42.010 --> 00:03:43.140
<i>To make bricks,</i>

00:03:43.550 --> 00:03:45.680
<i>first, knead clay,
put it in a wooden mold,</i>

00:03:45.890 --> 00:03:47.680
<i>then dry it for a month before firing it.</i>

00:03:48.180 --> 00:03:50.680
<i>When water doesn't drain properly,
what causes that?</i>

00:03:50.770 --> 00:03:52.020
<i>How can it be improved?</i>

00:03:52.310 --> 00:03:54.100
Looks like something
sparked a change in you.

00:03:54.860 --> 00:03:56.730
Don't get too serious, Ango.

00:03:58.440 --> 00:03:59.480
How would you escape this?

00:04:02.280 --> 00:04:03.860
You're going to get hurt, Professor.

00:04:04.450 --> 00:04:06.910
I bet Ban is going to be
at the top of the rankings this month.

00:04:06.990 --> 00:04:07.870
Ban?

00:04:07.950 --> 00:04:10.250
He's the best student
in the medicine class.

00:04:10.830 --> 00:04:12.750
<i>Our rankings change almost daily.</i>

00:04:13.460 --> 00:04:15.000
<i>Some people rise to the top fast.</i>

00:04:15.670 --> 00:04:16.630
<i>I can't afford to lose.</i>

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:21.470
<i>I can't afford to lose.</i>

00:04:21.550 --> 00:04:22.590
Ango...

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:28.970
It's dangerous to climb on your own.

00:04:30.680 --> 00:04:33.560
I've been climbing since I was a kid.
I can handle it.

00:04:34.230 --> 00:04:35.850
I climb when I want to focus.

00:04:37.190 --> 00:04:39.570
That knife you've got,
it's the same as ours.

00:04:40.150 --> 00:04:42.690
Yes. It's specially made and quite useful.

00:04:43.990 --> 00:04:46.910
Do you want to go to the future,
Professor Takashi?

00:04:47.870 --> 00:04:49.200
No, not me.

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:51.080
I'm having a child next year, anyway.

00:04:51.660 --> 00:04:52.620
Oh, I see.

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:54.790
Must be nice to be happy.

00:04:56.120 --> 00:04:59.130
Ango, the theme of the final test
will be attentiveness.

00:04:59.210 --> 00:05:00.670
Yes, I know that.

00:05:03.130 --> 00:05:05.550
So the other teams will be chosen
from among civilians.

00:05:06.130 --> 00:05:07.390
So it seems.

00:05:07.930 --> 00:05:11.350
Limiting the number of talented
individuals creates the best balance.

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:13.310
Is that how it is?

00:05:13.930 --> 00:05:18.860
In that case, I think it's best to add
a "reaper" to one of the teams.

00:05:19.520 --> 00:05:21.860
Personally, I'm against that idea.

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:25.070
By the way, about the final test...

00:05:29.700 --> 00:05:31.580
<i>We all turned 17.</i>

00:05:32.700 --> 00:05:34.620
Wait a second. This has a crack in it.

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:35.870
Hey, everybody.

00:05:36.290 --> 00:05:37.870
You should probably check your barrels--

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:42.300
-Blood and flesh...
-He's bleeding!

00:05:42.880 --> 00:05:44.800
Calm down. I'll stop the bleeding.

00:05:52.310 --> 00:05:55.100
Shigeru, wait! The rope looks discolored--

00:05:56.390 --> 00:05:58.350
Someone fell!

00:05:58.440 --> 00:05:59.900
The rope broke!

00:06:02.150 --> 00:06:04.150
I noticed it myself.

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:09.490
<i>For some reason,
Shigeru was distancing himself from me.</i>

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:13.910
Madonna, this is my job for this morning.

00:06:13.990 --> 00:06:16.540
-What do you think this is?
-Cowbane?

00:06:17.120 --> 00:06:19.210
Wait, in our food supplies?
It's poisonous.

00:06:19.620 --> 00:06:22.340
I've also found aconite
and amur adonis in here, too.

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:27.590
It might be best to grow and cook
all of our own supplies instead.

00:06:30.510 --> 00:06:32.550
It was carbon monoxide poisoning.

00:06:33.260 --> 00:06:35.560
They said that
those three saved Koruri's life.

00:06:36.270 --> 00:06:38.560
I'm just so thankful to them.

00:06:39.270 --> 00:06:41.810
The line between life and death
sure is thin, isn't it?

00:06:46.230 --> 00:06:48.030
Why do all of these accidents
keep happening?

00:06:51.240 --> 00:06:52.320
A Japanese playing card?

00:06:52.570 --> 00:06:55.660
The theme of the final test
will be attentiveness.

00:07:01.790 --> 00:07:04.590
Run for it! Get away from the building!

00:07:07.010 --> 00:07:08.840
<i>Why didn't I realize it sooner?</i>

00:07:09.010 --> 00:07:11.720
<i>The final test has already begun!</i>

00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:14.640
You just noticed? You've been lucky.

00:07:16.470 --> 00:07:17.680
<i>I've fallen behind!</i>

00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:19.640
Ango! Are you all right?

00:07:20.230 --> 00:07:21.850
-Mayu. Koruri.
-I don't feel so good.

00:07:22.190 --> 00:07:23.860
I'm glad you made it. Are you hurt?

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:26.610
We're okay. We got out
as soon as we heard the explosion.

00:07:26.730 --> 00:07:27.610
Shigeru!

00:07:29.400 --> 00:07:30.740
Hey, Shigeru! Wait up!

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:34.320
Shigeru, I don't know why
you're so upset with me,

00:07:34.410 --> 00:07:35.410
but wait a second.

00:07:37.490 --> 00:07:39.620
I'm going to the charcoal shed.

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:41.960
The winter gear is stored there.

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:48.250
Oh, someone is already here.

00:07:48.340 --> 00:07:49.210
Ukai...

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:51.130
Are you going to
take all of that with you?

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:53.340
Yes. First come, first served.

00:07:53.680 --> 00:07:56.600
Hey, now. That's not fair.
Let's share among ourselves.

00:07:56.680 --> 00:07:58.060
Sorry, I'm not giving you any.

00:07:58.140 --> 00:08:00.310
Ango, that's just plain mean!

00:08:00.390 --> 00:08:01.640
Got a problem with that?

00:08:04.980 --> 00:08:06.310
Ango, hold up.

00:08:06.820 --> 00:08:07.730
What's wrong?

00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:09.070
We've got a problem.

00:08:09.320 --> 00:08:11.530
All the animals are
gone from their stable.

00:08:12.030 --> 00:08:13.740
Some of them are really dangerous.

00:08:17.740 --> 00:08:18.660
Shigeru.

00:08:18.740 --> 00:08:20.410
Ango. Gengoro.

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:21.750
Glad to see you're okay.

00:08:21.830 --> 00:08:22.910
-Yes.
-Here, take this.

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:24.960
-I was at the animal stable.
-Hurry, get changed.

00:08:25.040 --> 00:08:27.540
On my way here, Ango filled me in
on what's happening.

00:08:28.380 --> 00:08:30.010
The school building is gone, too.

00:08:30.090 --> 00:08:31.970
Where did Ryo and the rest of them go?

00:08:32.260 --> 00:08:33.970
They didn't even hesitate at all.

00:08:37.760 --> 00:08:38.720
<i>Was this a hint?</i>

00:08:41.020 --> 00:08:43.980
<i>Japanese playing cards
represent 12 months.</i>

00:08:44.350 --> 00:08:46.560
<i>They also signify 12 directions.</i>

00:08:47.150 --> 00:08:50.320
<i>I thought that was how
we should decide which way to go.</i>

00:08:51.280 --> 00:08:55.700
<i>Shigeru and I had both found a card
that pointed in the same direction.</i>

00:08:56.360 --> 00:08:59.200
<i>For whatever reason,
he was in a sour mood the whole time.</i>

00:09:12.460 --> 00:09:17.220
<i>I suspect that this test will continue
until only seven of us are left.</i>

00:09:18.220 --> 00:09:20.220
<i>People kept dropping out,
one after the other.</i>

00:09:22.600 --> 00:09:26.730
<i>All we can do is keep going,
finding the path that will keep us alive,</i>

00:09:27.310 --> 00:09:29.230
<i>and leaving the dead behind.</i>

00:09:31.820 --> 00:09:32.900
<i>Schubert's "Ave Maria."</i>

00:09:32.980 --> 00:09:36.280
<i>We bow us to our lot of care</i>

00:09:40.030 --> 00:09:45.290
<i>In this test, we were each faced with
a certain problem that we had to overcome.</i>

00:09:51.130 --> 00:09:53.170
Mayu, I'm here. Mayu?

00:09:56.470 --> 00:09:58.340
Koruri, are you okay?

00:09:58.970 --> 00:10:00.050
Hyo...

00:10:00.890 --> 00:10:04.100
Mayu, she... Just a minute ago...

00:10:04.720 --> 00:10:07.440
Mayu! Mayu, keep breathing! I'll get help!

00:10:08.140 --> 00:10:10.480
Professor! Somebody help!

00:10:10.810 --> 00:10:13.400
Someone move this rock!
We have to save Mayu!

00:10:17.650 --> 00:10:20.320
Mayu did her best...

00:10:20.910 --> 00:10:22.910
It must have been hard for her...

00:10:23.410 --> 00:10:25.080
but now she's...

00:10:26.410 --> 00:10:27.910
in a better place.

00:10:31.420 --> 00:10:34.920
Koruri... Mayu left you a message.

00:10:35.960 --> 00:10:38.340
She said, when you go to the future,
give it your all.

00:10:40.510 --> 00:10:42.550
She said you can do anything
you put your mind to.

00:10:43.220 --> 00:10:44.560
You'll be okay.

00:10:45.520 --> 00:10:49.770
Koruri, live on in the future.

00:10:56.990 --> 00:10:57.900
Koruri!

00:10:59.740 --> 00:11:01.450
-Somebody save them!
-Koruri!

00:11:02.070 --> 00:11:03.200
-There's still time!
-Koruri!

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:04.990
-Get them to a hospital! Please!
-Koruri!

00:11:05.080 --> 00:11:07.500
-Nobara? Where is Nobara?
-Koruri! Get hold of yourself!

00:11:07.580 --> 00:11:08.910
I have to tell Nobara!

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:11.420
Nobara, please come and save Mayu.

00:11:11.500 --> 00:11:12.830
Nobara is already dead!

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:17.380
This is all his fault.

00:11:18.170 --> 00:11:20.630
He stole all of the gear.

00:11:21.050 --> 00:11:22.340
Where is Ango now?

00:11:24.100 --> 00:11:27.470
This red bracelet
belonged to Nobara, right?

00:11:31.020 --> 00:11:35.820
When I punched Unami and was put into
the special punishment room,

00:11:36.770 --> 00:11:41.280
Nobara was in there, her body ground up
among the livestock entrails.

00:11:42.030 --> 00:11:44.450
Everybody who failed the program
ended up the same way.

00:11:45.030 --> 00:11:47.370
Nobara and Mayu were
both killed by the professors.

00:11:48.200 --> 00:11:52.290
There are dead bodies all over.
Even now, the others are...

00:11:53.880 --> 00:11:55.670
Let's stick together, Koruri.

00:11:56.290 --> 00:11:57.880
We should have done that from the start.

00:11:58.630 --> 00:12:00.420
Those Japanese playing cards
were meaningless.

00:12:00.880 --> 00:12:05.350
They were only meant to separate us
and draw us away from where we were.

00:12:06.390 --> 00:12:07.260
Koruri?

00:12:08.260 --> 00:12:09.930
It's dangerous to be alone! Stop!

00:12:10.020 --> 00:12:11.020
Koruri!

00:12:12.440 --> 00:12:13.900
We're going after her, Shigeru.

00:12:13.980 --> 00:12:15.610
Don't boss me around.

00:12:16.360 --> 00:12:17.400
Shigeru?

00:12:17.570 --> 00:12:21.280
I finally figured out why you acted
so weird back then.

00:12:21.860 --> 00:12:23.610
It was because you saw Nobara.

00:12:24.490 --> 00:12:27.330
Yes, but I couldn't bring myself
to tell anybody.

00:12:27.700 --> 00:12:29.080
But you told Gengoro.

00:12:29.330 --> 00:12:31.450
Gengoro? What are you talking about?

00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:33.160
Why didn't you tell me?

00:12:33.830 --> 00:12:37.460
Why didn't you tell me about it?
I'm supposed to be your best friend!

00:12:37.590 --> 00:12:40.170
Why did you go
cry on Gengoro's shoulder about it?

00:12:40.250 --> 00:12:41.710
It should have been me!

00:12:42.260 --> 00:12:45.840
I know that you don't
consider me an equal, Ango.

00:12:46.260 --> 00:12:49.720
But I was okay with that, as long as
it meant I could be by your side.

00:12:50.470 --> 00:12:54.690
But Gengoro is your equal! You accept him!

00:12:54.770 --> 00:12:56.900
What am I to you, Ango?

00:12:57.150 --> 00:12:58.270
Shigeru...

00:12:58.360 --> 00:13:00.110
I'm not your partner.

00:13:01.230 --> 00:13:03.700
I'm just a lackey
who's always beneath you.

00:13:04.570 --> 00:13:06.950
But I get it. I'm worthless.

00:13:07.370 --> 00:13:10.370
I only made it this far
because you took pity on me.

00:13:11.330 --> 00:13:12.700
I would never survive on my own.

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:16.000
Shigeru! You're not worthless!

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:18.920
Liar! I know that's what you really think!

00:13:19.380 --> 00:13:21.340
You still look down on me!

00:13:21.420 --> 00:13:24.920
I don't want to be one of the seven
just because I happened to be with you!

00:13:25.010 --> 00:13:26.430
Shigeru! Wait!

00:13:27.050 --> 00:13:28.050
Shigeru...

00:13:33.270 --> 00:13:35.180
<i>I taught you never to dodge backward.</i>

00:13:35.770 --> 00:13:36.890
Dodge to the sides instead.

00:13:38.480 --> 00:13:41.020
That's right, Ryo. It's kill or be killed.

00:13:48.070 --> 00:13:49.120
Kill me.

00:13:49.530 --> 00:13:50.990
If you don't, I'll just attack again.

00:13:51.410 --> 00:13:54.290
You had no problem shooting all those
cardboard cutouts of people, right?

00:13:55.620 --> 00:13:58.000
This isn't the same thing.

00:14:00.710 --> 00:14:02.670
So you were all just show, Ryo.

00:14:05.300 --> 00:14:09.220
Will I really have to kill someday?

00:14:23.650 --> 00:14:24.900
I didn't...

00:14:26.280 --> 00:14:30.030
I didn't spend all that time raising him
just for this!

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:36.040
There's a limit to what I can do.

00:14:37.330 --> 00:14:39.330
Someone... Please help me...

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:44.500
Help... My body is going numb...

00:14:45.250 --> 00:14:46.590
I can't move...

00:14:50.090 --> 00:14:52.760
Where did I put those matches?

00:14:53.470 --> 00:14:55.220
<i>In your inside left pocket.</i>

00:15:01.650 --> 00:15:03.060
Shigeru isn't worthless.

00:15:04.690 --> 00:15:06.360
Where are my scissors?

00:15:06.440 --> 00:15:10.240
Last Friday, after you cut some cloth,
instead of putting them in the toolbox,

00:15:10.320 --> 00:15:12.160
you put them in the second drawer.

00:15:12.450 --> 00:15:14.280
How can you remember stuff like that?

00:15:14.450 --> 00:15:16.200
What? Because I saw you do it.

00:15:16.540 --> 00:15:18.660
<i>Sometimes his memory is incredible.</i>

00:15:18.750 --> 00:15:20.370
<i>But he struggles with getting things done.</i>

00:15:20.670 --> 00:15:23.040
<i>When we were little,
he was slow at using the dictionary.</i>

00:15:23.330 --> 00:15:26.670
It would be faster
to memorize the whole thing.

00:15:27.670 --> 00:15:29.800
<i>And that's exactly what he did.</i>

00:15:30.760 --> 00:15:32.300
<i>Shigeru isn't worthless.</i>

00:15:32.720 --> 00:15:36.470
<i>He panics and gets scared, which stops him
from reaching his full potential.</i>

00:15:36.970 --> 00:15:38.180
What do you want?

00:15:38.850 --> 00:15:41.890
I thought you let your guard down,
but it seems you're better than Ryo.

00:15:43.400 --> 00:15:46.940
Regarding how the seven are chosen,
one student from each class will make it.

00:15:47.650 --> 00:15:51.900
You, Ryo, and Shigeru are all in
the "fire" and "water" classes together.

00:15:52.700 --> 00:15:55.780
Which means, among the three of you,
only two will survive.

00:15:56.620 --> 00:15:59.120
Then Ryo will have to be
the one to drop out.

00:15:59.830 --> 00:16:03.540
However, the professors all want Ryo
to be one of the seven.

00:16:04.290 --> 00:16:07.380
That narrows it down
to either you or Shigeru surviving.

00:16:08.800 --> 00:16:10.090
I know you're good friends.

00:16:10.420 --> 00:16:11.720
Will you let Shigeru win?

00:16:12.840 --> 00:16:14.180
I'll share this with Shigeru, too.

00:16:15.010 --> 00:16:16.680
Maybe he'll let you go instead.

00:16:20.600 --> 00:16:22.520
I'm doing it the way
we were taught, but...

00:16:23.770 --> 00:16:25.900
Shigeru? What a surprise.

00:16:26.690 --> 00:16:27.650
Ukai?

00:16:28.650 --> 00:16:32.490
I've grasped the topography of the area
between eleven and three o'clock.

00:16:33.150 --> 00:16:37.240
I also know where the dangerous spots are
and where to get food, among other things.

00:16:38.080 --> 00:16:41.290
<i>I guess this is how things might be
if we go to the future.</i>

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:44.580
Morse code?

00:16:44.670 --> 00:16:49.500
<i>Shigeru hurt. Needs help.</i>

00:16:49.920 --> 00:16:54.720
<i>Come soon. Ukai.</i>

00:16:57.430 --> 00:16:59.930
There's no way
Ukai will be able to outsmart Ango.

00:17:01.970 --> 00:17:03.730
Ukai! Thanks for contacting me.

00:17:04.350 --> 00:17:07.270
Well, Ango. You sure seem to be
in good shape.

00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:08.270
Where's Shigeru?

00:17:08.360 --> 00:17:09.400
Over there.

00:17:10.570 --> 00:17:11.780
What exactly happened to him?

00:17:12.070 --> 00:17:13.070
I don't know.

00:17:13.360 --> 00:17:16.160
I just happened to stumble across him
collapsed on the ground.

00:17:19.660 --> 00:17:21.240
-Ango...
-Shigeru!

00:17:23.960 --> 00:17:25.960
-Ango!
-Don't move!

00:17:26.040 --> 00:17:27.630
Ukai, why did you do that?

00:17:27.920 --> 00:17:29.540
Leave all of your supplies behind.

00:17:30.040 --> 00:17:31.550
Forget about Ango.

00:17:31.750 --> 00:17:33.510
Do that and I'll spare your life.

00:17:34.260 --> 00:17:36.340
Forget it! I'm going to save Ango!

00:17:36.630 --> 00:17:38.510
He has to go to the future!

00:17:39.510 --> 00:17:42.270
Being apart from Ango
made me realize something.

00:17:43.020 --> 00:17:46.190
It's really scary
to make your own decisions.

00:17:46.690 --> 00:17:47.900
It requires courage.

00:17:48.940 --> 00:17:51.770
Where to go, what to eat, when to sleep.

00:17:51.980 --> 00:17:53.990
Ango always made all of those decisions.

00:17:54.610 --> 00:17:58.160
He took action and made decisions
on his own, and he took responsibility!

00:17:58.240 --> 00:18:01.160
That's exactly the kind of person
who has to go to the future!

00:18:01.240 --> 00:18:02.160
You're right.

00:18:03.950 --> 00:18:04.870
Stop! Shigeru!

00:18:08.830 --> 00:18:09.710
Stop!

00:18:11.960 --> 00:18:13.920
My legs and shoulders...

00:18:14.010 --> 00:18:15.210
Damn it!

00:18:15.800 --> 00:18:16.800
Ango!

00:18:17.680 --> 00:18:19.300
I'm so glad you're okay.

00:18:19.930 --> 00:18:23.720
Shigeru, did you team up with Ukai
to try and off me?

00:18:25.560 --> 00:18:26.600
<i>No, that can't be true.</i>

00:18:27.180 --> 00:18:29.270
<i>You know Shigeru would never do that.</i>

00:18:29.810 --> 00:18:31.940
I'm sorry. I never thought
it would end up like this.

00:18:32.320 --> 00:18:33.730
Well, you must be happy.

00:18:33.940 --> 00:18:35.480
I'm injured now,

00:18:35.900 --> 00:18:37.990
so you have a chance
of being one of the seven.

00:18:38.610 --> 00:18:40.320
<i>What am I saying?</i>

00:18:40.870 --> 00:18:42.910
I'm surprised at
how pathetic you sound, Ango.

00:18:43.620 --> 00:18:46.250
It's kind of exciting
to see you in a pitiful state.

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:48.160
Ryo? What the hell are you doing here?

00:18:49.120 --> 00:18:50.790
I was just passing through.

00:18:51.040 --> 00:18:52.710
Ukai froze to death in the forest.

00:18:54.170 --> 00:18:56.090
Seems the runt here got the better of him.

00:18:56.210 --> 00:18:57.380
Shigeru did?

00:18:57.470 --> 00:19:01.550
Ukai was in no state
to remember the path, but I am.

00:19:02.220 --> 00:19:04.260
Ango, I came here to save you.

00:19:08.140 --> 00:19:09.890
The rope has been cut.

00:19:09.980 --> 00:19:12.150
By the professors, no doubt.

00:19:12.230 --> 00:19:15.440
What are we going to do?
We can't reach a ledge that high up.

00:19:15.520 --> 00:19:16.980
Just calm down.

00:19:17.070 --> 00:19:19.700
They won't kill all three of us.

00:19:20.320 --> 00:19:21.490
I'm sure of that.

00:19:22.070 --> 00:19:25.240
Ango, I'm going to save you
no matter what.

00:19:25.330 --> 00:19:26.700
Shigeru...

00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:34.670
Release the belay.
I'm going to tie off the rope.

00:19:34.750 --> 00:19:36.250
That's as far as the rope can go.

00:19:38.630 --> 00:19:39.760
You can climb up now.

00:19:43.550 --> 00:19:46.930
I'll help pull you up,
so don't strain yourself.

00:19:47.010 --> 00:19:48.560
<i>I'm so pathetic.</i>

00:19:49.100 --> 00:19:52.440
<i>I should be thanking him
for his help right now.</i>

00:19:52.520 --> 00:19:53.810
Ango,

00:19:54.190 --> 00:19:59.150
this is the first time
that your life has been in my hands.

00:20:00.030 --> 00:20:02.610
Shigeru... The belay here is okay.

00:20:02.950 --> 00:20:04.030
I'm going up, then.

00:20:06.280 --> 00:20:10.040
Going to the future is impossible for me.

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:14.710
I've always thought that.
But now, it's different.

00:20:14.960 --> 00:20:18.050
Now I'm going to go with you, Ango,
to the future.

00:20:21.630 --> 00:20:23.800
Wait, Shigeru! Are you injured right now?

00:20:23.880 --> 00:20:25.260
What?

00:20:25.800 --> 00:20:26.890
I'm fine.

00:20:27.220 --> 00:20:29.100
I'm going to set up an auto belay here.

00:20:29.180 --> 00:20:31.270
I'll switch positions with you!
Just wait there!

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:34.230
I forgot to unhook the line!

00:20:43.610 --> 00:20:44.610
Shigeru!

00:20:44.700 --> 00:20:45.950
Don't shake the line, Ango!

00:20:46.120 --> 00:20:47.530
Shigeru, grab onto the rock!

00:20:49.120 --> 00:20:50.490
If this comes undone, then...

00:20:51.120 --> 00:20:53.910
Say something, Shigeru!
Pull yourself together!

00:20:56.710 --> 00:20:58.840
I understand now, Professor Takashi.

00:20:58.920 --> 00:21:00.710
This was the role you meant for me.

00:21:03.510 --> 00:21:04.510
Ryo!

00:21:04.590 --> 00:21:08.430
This is something
neither you nor Shigeru can handle.

00:21:08.680 --> 00:21:09.600
Don't do it!

00:21:11.180 --> 00:21:12.180
Stop, Ryo!

00:21:12.270 --> 00:21:14.560
But me? I can handle it.

00:21:14.640 --> 00:21:15.810
Stop!

00:21:16.440 --> 00:21:17.730
Please don't do it!

00:21:21.820 --> 00:21:22.900
Shigeru...

00:21:29.580 --> 00:21:32.040
Congratulations. This settles it.

00:21:34.620 --> 00:21:36.370
Please save Shigeru, too.

00:21:36.920 --> 00:21:38.170
He's still down there.

00:21:38.960 --> 00:21:41.050
I'm glad things are finally settled.

00:21:41.800 --> 00:21:43.630
It was worth cutting that rope.

00:21:43.710 --> 00:21:44.920
So, it was you who did it.

00:21:45.380 --> 00:21:46.590
Ryo, this is why...

00:21:47.180 --> 00:21:50.100
you should have killed me
when you had the chance.

00:21:51.180 --> 00:21:53.970
Don't make the same mistake
when you get to the future.

00:21:55.600 --> 00:21:56.850
That's the end of the test.

00:21:58.440 --> 00:21:59.360
Congratulations.

00:22:00.150 --> 00:22:02.860
You all have the glory
of being among the chosen seven.

00:22:03.230 --> 00:22:05.860
After overcoming this harsh test,

00:22:05.950 --> 00:22:08.280
nothing will ever be able to defeat you.

00:22:18.080 --> 00:22:21.380
You should be celebrating.
You can finally go to the future now.

00:22:21.460 --> 00:22:22.380
I won't go.

00:22:22.460 --> 00:22:24.550
If Mayu isn't going, I'm not going either.

00:22:25.460 --> 00:22:29.220
Why can't Mayu be the one to go?
Why did I have to be chosen? Why?

00:22:29.430 --> 00:22:30.340
I won't go either.

00:22:31.100 --> 00:22:34.560
Some of the animals are still out there.
I can't just abandon them.

00:22:35.220 --> 00:22:39.690
Me too. I can't go.
I won't be of any help.

00:22:39.770 --> 00:22:41.110
You morons!

00:22:42.020 --> 00:22:45.230
Do you want the death of your friends
to go to waste?

00:22:45.900 --> 00:22:47.440
They all wanted to go to the future.

00:22:48.030 --> 00:22:50.200
You should respect those wishes!

00:22:51.200 --> 00:22:53.450
Take them away.
Examine them all thoroughly.

00:22:53.530 --> 00:22:57.910
I'll kill you, Unami! Damn you, Unami!

00:23:01.250 --> 00:23:02.250
Good, you're all awake.

00:23:02.330 --> 00:23:03.250
Unami?

00:23:03.840 --> 00:23:05.960
But... why are you here?

00:23:06.550 --> 00:23:09.720
Since you're a bunch of wusses,
they decided to add an adult to the group.

00:23:16.180 --> 00:23:19.520
Ango! This isn't like you guys!

00:23:25.610 --> 00:23:27.530
Hey, don't--

00:23:31.110 --> 00:23:33.700
It's unfair... So unfair...

00:23:34.870 --> 00:23:37.830
My dad was just
a quiet government worker...

00:23:38.120 --> 00:23:39.410
What about Mr. Kaname?

00:23:39.500 --> 00:23:40.460
Who?

00:23:40.540 --> 00:23:43.000
Do you know him? Kaname Mozunoto?

00:23:43.540 --> 00:23:44.670
Kaname?

00:23:45.250 --> 00:23:46.090
Kaname...

00:23:51.550 --> 00:23:52.590
Kanny?

00:23:52.680 --> 00:23:54.090
So you do know him.

00:23:54.510 --> 00:23:56.430
Mr. Kaname was one
of the ringleaders, too.

00:23:56.930 --> 00:24:00.060
Well, he actually might have been
a more significant figure than that.

00:24:01.140 --> 00:24:04.520
I only knew him
from when I was very, very young.

00:24:04.980 --> 00:24:07.860
I can't even remember what he looked like.
